1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
This is Bubbly (bubbly.app.br), a scheduling app for beauty salons.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:11,000
The homepage links to our Privacy Policy.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
The login page links to our Privacy Policy and Terms of Service.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
The user clicks “Sign in with Google” (Entrar com Google).

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:35,000
The user signs in with a Google test account.

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Consent screen: Bubbly requests Google Sign-In, calendar.events and contacts.readonly.

7
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:49,000
The user grants access and returns to Bubbly.

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:01:09,000
calendar.events: we create a test appointment for a fictitious client.

9
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Bubbly writes the appointment to the user's Google Calendar as an event.

10
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:34,000
When the appointment time is changed in Bubbly…

11
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:44,000
…the same Google Calendar event is updated.

12
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:56,000
When the appointment is cancelled in Bubbly…

13
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:06,000
…the event is removed from Google Calendar.

14
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Existing Google Calendar events (e.g. “Dentist”) appear in Bubbly only as busy time, so clients cannot book over them.

15
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:26,000
contacts.readonly: Clients › Import › From Google Contacts.

16
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:36,000
The user picks which contacts to import as clients.

17
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:42,000
Only the selected contacts are copied into Bubbly.

18
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:52,000
Google Contacts is read-only for Bubbly: nothing changes in the user's Google account.

19
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Settings shows links to the Privacy Policy and Terms at the bottom.

20
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:08,000
The Privacy Policy has a section on how Bubbly uses Google user data.

21
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:18,000
Settings › Calendars: the user can disconnect Google Calendar at any time.

22
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Reconnecting asks for consent again.

23
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:34,000
Same consent screen, same scopes.

24
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:40,000
Google Calendar is connected again.

25
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:50,000
Privacy Policy › Google user data: bubbly.app.br/privacidade#google.

26
00:03:50,000 --> 00:04:00,000
My profile › Delete my account removes the account and its data. Not completed in this demo.

27
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:04,000
Thank you.
